* ADC_TOP: both CDAC array sides (four-leg bottom-plate switches, local
* drivers) and the per-side top-plate V_cm switch (DR-0014), all in ONE
* flat extracted instance, PMOS-body-remediated and MiM-mapped to the
* native PDK subckt (layout/adc-top/parasitics/remediate_extracted.py).
* Comparator and controller stay schematic-level (Scope item 0).
Xdut se_sel_hi_n_128n se_sel_hi_n_128p se_sel_hi_n_16n se_sel_hi_n_16p
+ se_sel_hi_n_1n se_sel_hi_n_1p se_sel_hi_n_256n se_sel_hi_n_256p
